  - Index: 51
    Text: 'Quest complete:'
  - Index: 52
    Text: 'New quest:'
  - Index: 53
    Text: All quests complete!
  - Index: 54
    Text: Nearest
  - Index: 55
    Text: 'V BLOOD CLAIMED

      <size=26>The Minotaur Warlord has fallen. Demo
      complete - thanks for playing!</size>'
  - Index: 56
    Text: 'Reward:'
  - Index: 57
    Text: Tutorial
  - Index: 58
    Text: The Hunt
  - Index: 59
    Text: V Blood
  - Index: 7001
    Text: Awakening
  - Index: 7101
    Text: You wake from a long slumber. Walk around with WASD to stretch your legs.
  - Index: 7002
    Text: Taste of Steel
  - Index: 7102
    Text: Click the Left Mouse button to swing your weapon. Click in rhythm to chain
      a combo.
  - Index: 7003
    Text: Weapon Arts
  - Index: 7103
    Text: Use your weapon skill. Q and E change with the weapon you wield.
  - Index: 7004
    Text: Veil of Blood
  - Index: 7104
    Text: Dash with Veil of Blood. Attacks pass through you while dashing.
  - Index: 7005
    Text: Blood Magic
  - Index: 7105
    Text: Cast Chaos Volley. Hitting an Ignited enemy again makes it explode.
  - Index: 7006
    Text: The Merchant
  - Index: 7106
    Text: Talk to the Wandering Merchant beside the camp (or press P) and take any
      item. Everything is free.
  - Index: 7007
    Text: Gatherer
  - Index: 7107
    Text: Strike trees
  - Index: 7008
    Text: Handiwork
  - Index: 7108
    Text: Open the crafting menu and make anything. Cloth armor only needs Plant
      Fiber.
  - Index: 7009
    Text: Dressed for the Night
  - Index: 7109
    Text: Open the inventory and equip a chest armor (Cloth Robe or Reinforced Chest).
  - Index: 7010
    Text: A Castle of Your Own
  - Index: 7110
    Text: Open the build menu and place a Castle Heart (20 Lumber
  - Index: 7011
    Text: A Place to Rest
  - Index: 7111
    Text: Build a Coffin near your Castle Heart. You will rise there when you die.
  - Index: 7012
    Text: First Hunt
  - Index: 7112
    Text: Medusa Sentinels lurk just north of the camp. Slay 3 of them.
  - Index: 7013
    Text: The Feeding
  - Index: 7113
    Text: Bring an enemy below 25% health
  - Index: 7014
    Text: Serpents
  - Index: 7114
    Text: Cobra Snakes shoot from afar in the Ruined Hamlet and the Serpent Marsh.
      Slay 3.
  - Index: 7015
    Text: Copper Age
  - Index: 7115
    Text: Stronger foes await. Craft copper gear at a Workbench (or take it from
      the merchant) and reach Gear Level 16.
  - Index: 7016
    Text: Troll Ridge
  - Index: 7116
    Text: Cave Trolls roam Troll Ridge far to the north. Beware their charge. Slay
      3.
  - Index: 7017
    Text: 'V Blood: Minotaur Warlord'
  - Index: 7117
    Text: The Minotaur Warlord rules the arena in the north-east. Defeat it - feed
      on it to claim its V Blood.
